@startuml
title State machine model of a Staff Member

[*] --> Unassigned

state Unassigned
Unassigned : do / display availability

state AssignedToClient
AssignedToClient : do / manage client interaction

state AssignedToCampaign
AssignedToCampaign : do / manage campaign tasks

state Unemployed
Unemployed : do / mark as unavailable

state Archived
Archived : do / store historical data

Unassigned --> AssignedToClient : Assigned to Client
Unassigned --> AssignedToCampaign : Assigned to Campaign

AssignedToClient --> Unassigned : Removed from Client
AssignedToCampaign --> Unassigned : Removed from Campaign

AssignedToClient --> AssignedToCampaign : Switch Assignment
AssignedToCampaign --> AssignedToClient : Switch Assignment

AssignedToClient --> Unemployed : Staff Member Leaves
AssignedToCampaign --> Unemployed : Staff Member Leaves

Unemployed --> Archived : Time Passed

@enduml
